Beef, Casein, and Soy Proteins
Differentially Affect Lipid
Metabolism, Triglycerides
Accumulation and Gut Microbiota of
High-Fat Diet-Fed C57BL/6J Mice
Muhammad Umair Ijaz 1,2 , Muhammad Ijaz Ahmed 1,2 , Xiaoyou Zou 1,2 , Muzahir Hussain 1,2 ,
Min Zhang 1,2 , Fan Zhao 1,2 , Xinglian Xu 1,2 , Guanghong Zhou 1,2 and Chunbao Li 1,2*
