Key Laboratory of Meat Processing and Quality Control, MOE, Jiangsu Collaborative Innovation Center of Meat Production,
Processing and Quality Control, Nanjing Agricultural University, Nanjing, China, 2 Key Laboratory of Meat Processing, MOA,
