Figure 1.  Experimental design of the two feed restriction trials: one of moderate intensity (M) and one of
high intensity (H) in dairy cows. Before and after the feed restriction periods, all cows received 100% of their
ad libitum dry matter intake. During feed restriction, rations were reduced relative to the pre-experimental
